      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Two Victorian fillies on debut for the Lee stable look to hold the key to this. JILLIBY CONNECTION (6) is a daughter of Classic Connection and has shown talent in winning her last two trials. Draws a little wide but is sure to be well-educated as is Bold Eagle filly KEAYANG ZABRINA (1), who is a half sister to wonder mare Keayang Zahara. Runner-up to JILLIBY CONNECTION in her latest trial but she does get the advantage of the inside draw. INTHE NORTY CORNER (8) cops the outside barrier but was good when a close second on debut at Ballarat. Should be improved by the hitout and that experience edge could prove helpful. LALI (3) is a locally-trained filly who has been solid in her trials at this circuit and draws well enough to be competitive.",
